  m_text: 'This popup is only visible in the under-development environment. It allows
    you to populate dummy data for testing authentication and connection functionality,
    as original data is not yet available.


    To test the setup, click Player
    1 from one instance and Player 2 from another instance.

    Do not click the
    same player button on both instances, or authentication will fail.


    This
    popup will not appear in the final build or production release.

'
